@InventoryApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Check Inventory Stock for Keyboard
GET {{InventoryApi_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/KEYBOARD-001
Accept: application/json

### 2. Check Inventory Stock for Non-Existent SKU (404)
GET {{InventoryApi_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/DOES-NOT-EXIST
Accept: application/json

### 3. Reserve Stock (Valid Request)
POST {{InventoryApi_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KEYBOARD-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 4. Reserve Stock Exceeding Available Quantity (400 Insufficient Stock)
POST {{InventoryApi_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KEYBOARD-001",
  "quantity": 9999
}
